#: wm-suite-hub.php
msgid "WM Suite Hub (Enterprise Cockpit)"
msgstr "WM Suite Hub (Deais Fiontair)"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: wm-suite-hub.php
msgid "https://arnoldwender.com/wordpress-plugins/wm-suite-hub/"
msgstr "https://arnoldwender.com/wordpress-plugins/wm-suite-hub/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-suite-hub.php
msgid ""
"Registry and health overview of the WM Suite plugins, a CycloneDX 1.6 "
"software bill of materials and an audit table whose entries are chained with "
"HMAC-SHA256."
msgstr ""
"Clárlann agus forbhreathnú sláinte ar bhreiseáin WM Suite, bille ábhar "
"bogearraí CycloneDX 1.6 agus tábla iniúchta a bhfuil a iontrálacha "
"slabhraithe le HMAC-SHA256."

#. Author of the plugin
